Z||000002||Formula88||06-24-2001||11:42 PM||||Does your horn work, or does the relay just make a dull buzzing noise?  How about the cigarette lighter?  They're all on the same fuse.  When my cigarette lighter went bad, it blew the fuse and I lost my radio presets.  Check that out.||||reg||4
